Nucleation and schematic-mesher power file decoding and meshing.
Nucleation 0.10.14 is used unmodified from crates.io. src/litematic.rs,
src/schematic.rs and src/meshing.rs contain application-owned readers/adapters
adapted from its MIT-licensed implementation (Copyright (c) 2025 Schem-at); the
full license is in ThirdParty/Nucleation-LICENSE.txt.
schematic-mesher 0.2.0 is also used unmodified from crates.io. src/meshing/
adapts its public builders for neighbor-aware chunks, stable texture atlases and
mesh buffer ownership. Its license is in ThirdParty/schematic-mesher-LICENSE.txt.

See ThirdParty/ for bundled dependency license texts.

Third-party Minecraft resource pack
------------------------------------

No resource pack is bundled here. Consumers supply their own; the packs shipped
with Minecraft are copyrighted by Mojang AB and/or its licensors and are not
covered by the AGPL license in LICENSE. The opt-in `inspect_memory` diagnostic
reads one from the path in `LP_MEMORY_PACK`.